WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
every day

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,040
This is indifference

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:12,310
Eat more meat

4
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:13,590
Just feed the bones to the dog

5
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:20,320
The leftovers are all yours. You washed the dishes and collected them later.

6
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:22,430
He saved food for his comrades

7
00:00:22,910 --> 00:00:25,510
The dead brothers can’t be separated and eaten.

8
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:26,950
I asked the boss for permission

9
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:41,810
You really sacrificed your life for him

10
00:00:42,050 --> 00:00:43,410
If you agree, you have to fight
